---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Data Converter cookie policy — minimal, functional cookies only." keywords="cookie policy, cookies, Google Analytics, data converter" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'Cookies',url:'/cookies'}]} schema={{
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Cookie Policy',
  description: 'Data Converter uses minimal cookies — functional theme preference and Google Analytics.',
  about: { '@type': 'Thing', name: 'Cookies' },
}}>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: July 2026</em></p>

    <p>Data Converter uses very few cookies. Here's exactly what they do.</p>

    <h2>Functional Cookies</h2>
    <table class="cookie-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>theme</code></td><td>Remembers your light/dark mode preference so the site looks right when you come back.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>I use Google Analytics to see which pages people visit and how the site is used. Google Analytics sets its own cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_gid</code>, <code>_gat</code>) that track anonymous, aggregate usage data. I don't use this data to identify individual users.</p>

    <h2>No Advertising Cookies</h2>
    <p>I don't serve ads on this site, so there are no advertising or tracking cookies from ad networks.</p>

    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>Most browsers let you control cookies through their settings. You can block or delete cookies at any time. If you disable cookies, the theme preference won't persist between visits, but the converter tool itself will still work fine.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about cookies? <a href="/contact">Let me know</a>.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .legal em {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 550;
    margin: 28px 0 10px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .legal p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .cookie-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cookie-table th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cookie-table td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cookie-table code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal { margin: 24px auto; }
    .legal h1 { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
